只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Manage the DSH web service from a settings panel: status, version, restart, stop and one-click updates. | DSH Web 服务管理面板:状态、版本、重启、停止与一键更新。","id":"gh:1339557782","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-web-service-manager","slug":"wiyi/dsh-web-service-manager","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Manage the DSH web service from a settings panel: status, version, restart, stop and one-click updat"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"es. | DSH Web 服务管理面板:状态、版本、重启、停止与一键更新。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-web-service-manager"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"在 DeepSeek Harness 内部管理 `dsh web` 服务 —— 日常操作无需再开终端。Manage the `dsh web` service from inside DeepSeek"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" Harness — no terminal needed for day-to-day operations."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## 中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"### 功能"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **状态面板**(设置 → DSH Web 服务):运行状态、版本、端口、PID、会话运行时长。\n- **重启**:先把替换实例放进独立进程会话,再退役当前进程 —— 新服务不受旧进程优雅清理(S"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"IGTERM → 根 fiber dispose)的影响。\n- **停止**:终止当前服务(面板所在的 GUI 会随之关闭)。\n- **版本检查**:与 npm registry 对比当前运行版本。\n"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"- **一键更新**:发现新版本后,通过 `npx` 拉取最新 `@deepseek-ai/dsh` 并自动重启。"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### 安装"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"重启一次 web 服务,然后打开 设置 → **DSH Web 服务**。"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### 工作原理"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"宿主半提供 `GET /dsh-web-manager/status`、`GET /dsh-web-manager/check`、`POST /dsh-web-manager/restart`、`PO"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ST /dsh-web-manager/update`、`POST /dsh-web-manager/stop`;写操作要求同源请求。"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"重启与更新使用小型看门狗链:替换实例以独立进程会话(`detached: true`)启动,**先于**旧进程退役。因为 SIGTERM 会让 harness 销毁整个组合 —— 包括所有托管子进程;"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"只有脱离进程组的替换实例能在这场清理中存活下来。"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### 注意事项"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- **停止**会关掉你正在使用的 GUI;重新启动需在终端运行 `npx @deepseek-ai/dsh web`。\n- **重启/更新**后,等新实例接管端口,再手动刷新页面。\n- 安装插件意味"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"着以你的权限运行第三方代码。本插件会停止、启动和更新 web 服务进程,在重要环境安装前请阅读源码。"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## English"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Features"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- **Status panel** (Settings → DSH Web 服务): running state, version, port, PID, session uptime.\n- **R"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"estart**: detaches a replacement instance into its own process session before retiring the current o"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ne, so the new server survives the old process's graceful teardown.\n- **Stop**: terminates the curre"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"nt service (this also closes the GUI the panel lives in).\n- **Version check**: compares the running "},{"id":"p18s5","text":"version with the npm registry.\n- **Update & restart**: pulls the latest `@deepseek-ai/dsh` through `"},{"id":"p18s6","text":"npx` and restarts on it."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Install"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Restart the web service once, then open Settings → **DSH Web 服务**."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### How it works"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The host half serves `GET /dsh-web-manager/status`, `GET /dsh-web-manager/check`, `POST /dsh-web-man"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ager/restart`, `POST /dsh-web-manager/update`, and `POST /dsh-web-manager/stop`. Mutating routes req"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"uire a same-origin request."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Restart and update use a small watchdog chain: the replacement instance is spawned in its own proces"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"s session (`detached: true`) *before* the current process is retired — on SIGTERM the harness dispos"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"es its whole composition, including every managed child process, and a detached replacement is the o"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"nly child that survives that cleanup."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### Notes"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- **Stop** ends the GUI you are using; start it again from a terminal with `npx @deepseek-ai/dsh web"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"`.\n- After **restart** or **update**, refresh the page once the new instance has taken over the port"},{"id":"p26s3","text":".\n- Installing a plugin runs third-party code with your own permissions. This plugin stops, starts a"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"nd updates the web service process; read the source before installing it anywhere important."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
